{"id":"639975","name":"熬鸡枞花油香覃","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/639975/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"小鸡枞花","amount":"400g"},{"name":"花生油","amount":"200g"}],"sub":[{"name":"腰果","amount":"几个"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"1匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"采的小鸡枞花洗净。","img":"images/639975/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"沥干水分备用。","img":"images/639975/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"葱切丝，蒜切末，花椒八角备好。","img":"images/639975/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"取腰果切碎。","img":"images/639975/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"干辣椒切段。","img":"images/639975/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"取白芝麻备好。","img":"images/639975/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/639975/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"油热放花椒等爆香。","img":"images/639975/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放鸡枞花。","img":"images/639975/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"翻拌的时候放食盐。","img":"images/639975/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"拌匀中大火开始熬菌油。","img":"images/639975/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"熬10分钟的时候放生抽。","img":"images/639975/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"继续熬。","img":"images/639975/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"大约15分钟的时候，水分已经很少了，放腰果。","img":"images/639975/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"拌匀继续熬几分钟放白糖。","img":"images/639975/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放鸡精。","img":"images/639975/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"继续熬至菌柄开始发黄啦。","img":"images/639975/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"放辣椒，继续熬几分钟。","img":"images/639975/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"关火。","img":"images/639975/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"放熟芝麻。","img":"images/639975/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"拌匀即可。","img":"images/639975/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"看看，诱人不？！","img":"images/639975/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"放凉，装起来即可。","img":"images/639975/step_23.jpg"}],"tips":"想吃菌油就油多一些。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}